    "f3"
   ],
   "spoken": "After Black's c6 and d5, White braces e4 with f3 and keeps the big pawn chain — the standard clamp against the Gurgenidze, holding a broad centre.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Meet the c6-and-d5 Gurgenidze by shoring up e4 with f3 and keeping the full centre.",
   "plans": "Hold the centre, develop, and castle long."
  },
