   "line": [
    "dxe5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Black's e5 break comes too early. After White captures, Black is simply worse — the centre opens in White's favour with far better development.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Don't strike in the centre before you're developed; a premature break just hands the opponent a lead."
